<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 1.4 trln yen of six-month T-bills.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 1.4 trln yen of six-month T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Wednesday it was offering 1.4 trillion yen worth of six-month Treasury bills through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be February 10, 1997, and the maturity date will be August 11, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
